            ]
          },
          "text": "感謝天主賜給我慈幼會的聖召，使我成為神父，服侍天主、服務青年，也為你們服務。\n\n77年前的今天，我發願加入慈幼會，一切都是恩寵。我也不斷反躬自省：「我有做好天主交給我的使命嗎？」\n\n但願在這歲月裡，我沒有一刻辜負過祂的召叫。\n\nDeo gratias!\n\nI thank God for the gift of my Salesian vocation, for calling me to the priesthood, to serve God, to serve the young, and to serve all of you.\n\nSeventy-seven years ago today, I made my first profession as a Salesian. Everything has been grace. I continually ask myself: “Have I faithfully fulfilled the mission God has entrusted to me?”\n\nI pray that, throughout all these years, I have never failed to be faithful to His call.\n\n#Salesians #DonBosco #SDB #77Years"
        },
